{"When cursor.is_prev is true, start_offset is set to offset without validation, allowing negative offsets which cause Django QuerySet AssertionError (500 error) since negative slicing is not supported": 0.8732659220695496, "OptimizedCursorPaginator uses math.floor/ceil on the order-by value which assumes a numeric field, but order_by=\"-datetime\" passes a datetime value causing TypeError when optimized_pagination=true": 0.9341065883636475, "The condition len(results) == offset + limit + extra is incorrect - results length will be limit + extra (stop - start_offset), so condition only evaluates true when offset is 0, causing off-by-one logic error with extra items in results": 0.6348506808280945, "OptimizedCursorPaginator.get_result is largely a copy of BasePaginator.get_result with small differences, making future fixes easy to miss - should refactor to extract shared logic": 0.26010873913764954}